# Pet API

## GET /pet/{id}

### Description
Fetch pet details using ID.

### Request
https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/{id}

### Path Parameter
- id (required): Pet ID

### Sample Response
```json
{
  "id": 77357,
  "name": "sasha",
  "status": "available"
}
-----------------------

DELETE /pet/{id}
Description

Deletes a pet by ID.

Request

https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/{id}

Path Parameters
id (required): Pet ID
api_key (optional)
Sample Response
{
  "code": 1,
  "message": "Pet not found"
}
